{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>VictusForm 是一款專為力量訓練設計的離線優先健身日誌，適合重視隱私、專注度及操作效率的運動愛好者。目前 App Store 提供限時免費下載，用戶無需訂閱或註冊帳號，即可享受無廣告且數據完全保留在本地裝置的使用體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>智能追蹤與結構化訓練</h2>\n<p>內建超過 1,200 種動作庫並支持 Apple Watch 即時記錄，可輕鬆管理組數、RPE 及自動漸進超負荷計劃。應用預設離線運行以保障隱私，僅需單次購買即可永久擁有所有功能，讓訓練者在無需網絡連接的情況下，靈活規劃週期並透過導出文件分享訓練成果。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-548-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-549-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-550-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-551-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-552-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-553-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：VictusForm – Workout Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T08:38:32.360647+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":322,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}